# Put your own documents here (.md / .markdown / .txt / .rst / .pdf) and rebuild:
#
#   python -m glassbox ingest      # index everything under corpus/
#   python -m glassbox serve       # start the UI
#
# run.sh / run.bat seed the 12 bundled demo documents into this folder on first
# launch, then never touch it again. To restore them after editing, run:
#
#   python scripts/seed_corpus.py --force
#
# This file only exists so git keeps the (otherwise empty) folder.
